{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's Health and Wellness Column", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Long Life", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe unusual events through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about a past action that has a connection to the present time. The action either finished in the past, just recently finished or, in some cases, continues to the present time.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you can use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect</span> there is a connection between what happened in the past and now. You use time markers like <span class=\"italic\">for</span>, <span class=\"italic\">just</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ever</span>, <span class=\"italic\">during</span> with the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The form of the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect</span> tense is:  <br/> <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">has</span>/<span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">She has enjoyed </span>bacon for over a hundred years.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She's one of about 30 supercentenarians, or people who have lived past their 110th birthday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Her nearly perfect bill of health has amazed doctors. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Jones has even appeared to be \"reverse aging.\" ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Over the last four years, her hair has changed from gray to brown and softened. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Be Supposed To </span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span></span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span></span> to talk about situations in the past, present or future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:  <br/> <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">To be</span> + <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">She is supposed to take </span>her blood-pressure medication and a multivitamin.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**: <br/>When you say <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span></span>, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. <br/> <br/> Like this: <span class=\"italic\">be suppose_to</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Every morning with a glass of water, she is supposed to take her blood-pressure medication and a multivitamin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She is supposed to see the doctor every 3 months for \"maintenance\".", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The question is: How are we supposed to live to achieve a life likes Jones'?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bacon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "greasy meat from the pork's back and sides ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cindy has enjoyed bacon for over a hundred years. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about staying healthy.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to verify", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to confirm that something is true", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Doctors still cannot verify supercentenarians' secret to long life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "supercentenarian ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is over 110 years old", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cindy is one of about 30 supercentenarians.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "longevity ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the whole duration of a person's life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Supercentenarians' longevity seems to be a mystery to science.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unparalleled ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unique; with no precedents", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cindy Jones's long life isn't unparalleled.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bill of health", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a statement that presents a person's physical and mental condition", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cindy's nearly perfect bill of health has amazed doctors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "regimen", "type": "name"}, {"content": "eating and exercising habits to preserve a person's health", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Jones' daily regimen is uncomplicated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bewilderment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "confusion", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To the bewilderment of Jones' physicians, she has appeared to be \u201creverse aging\u201d.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inconclusive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "with no final results or outcome", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The research on longevity is inconclusive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research who the oldest person in your country is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Prepare some notes about what you learned.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your notes with a partner - summarize what the oldest person does to stay young.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify who the oldest person in my country is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes about the key points of the information I found.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the information with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about people's habits and staying healthy.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "template_override": 1, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about people's habits and about staying healthy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I have done or things that have happened.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"},